Status-enum reconciliation: standardise the EPOS, dashboard, and customer
order-status screens on the Order entity value `in_kitchen` (they currently
write/read `preparing`). AdminOrders.jsx / OrderHistory.jsx already use the
correct values, so production data is a mix — run the data backfill in
entities/README.md BEFORE deploying. Display labels stay "Preparing"; only the
stored status VALUE changes.

Apply from the APP repo root (where src/ lives):
    git apply docs/claude-integration/reference/status-enum-reconciliation.patch

